  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to advance thought leadership, building on robust research, data and evidence, as well as future oriented scenarios to present integrated solutions to the region&#x2019;s multi-faceted development challenges. The project will aim to contribute to shaping and adopting effective public policies that can drive progress in line with Agenda 2030.</narrative>
